{"title":"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many triples <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/b/31b1e1af4531148cbc079023f68c2b0102c4ee69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y, z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"61\" height=\"20\" /> of rational numbers satisfy the following system of equations?\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/4/cb4f2f6c066fdf3e19a4c00b4b857b370efce57b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}  x + y + z &amp;= 0\\\\ xyz + 4z &amp;= 0\\\\ xy + xz + yz + 2y &amp;= 0 \\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"176\" height=\"66\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/72079803c6fcdcfa95b6d7f383f6ad71f1eb631b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=0$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/7/b87bc36b8bb7731e7227dc5515ef151bf4e4defa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/6/516f377ff288489267c47a54806f487ef2414547.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy + 2y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />. We can rearrange and solve:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/a/9ba78f6f91281e29075ab65e7f7fac5740b34a83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy + 2y = 2x + 2y \\Rightarrow xy = 2x \\Rightarrow x=0, y =2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"360\" height=\"16\" />. \n</p><p>This results in solutions: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/1/7a1766760477b0d829f1e01f0bf3bc4547c6683f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y,z) = (0,0,0), (-2,2,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"219\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/2/682d15d010bda1c163816c22f92c6024c41b8ce1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z\\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/0/d705a0dfc4c61722115072fdff835d7dfc9118c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+z = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/b/ccb504579a0e80420b4737df785b7ba0e927154b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xyz +4z = 0 \\Rightarrow xy = -4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"198\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/c/f9c9df286dee9ed5228e498b9f429851561a511b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy+yz+xz + 2y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"176\" height=\"16\" />. We can set up a 3rd degree polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/1/1411b4cdb90fcfd2f55c9c77320893b4b4d6d911.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(t)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> with roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/accc80fdf164cef264f56a82b6f9f6add320fe05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y,z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" />, so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/6/736efbbca76c3e9bc007b73b76d79fb899a1e94c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(t) = t^3 -2yt +4z = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"190\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II\">2014 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mathcontest.unm.edu/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><